Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.75,0:01:15.36,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}原本習慣的日常也全被淘汰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:17.96,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}夢想過平靜的安穩生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}卻因缺乏刺激懶懶散散
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.10,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}餘輝次第熄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:25.73,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們走慣的道路到底在何方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:28.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}偶爾因世態炎涼惱火
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.47,0:01:30.90,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}只是身在福中不知福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:33.07,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}火光亮起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.07,0:01:35.50,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}指引方向
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:41.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}回憶中響起了溫柔旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.61,0:01:47.70,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世無永恆 萬物皆為雲煙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.70,0:01:53.01,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}不妨坦然接受 嘗試微笑以對
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:57.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}燭華不吝照耀 光芒終將殆盡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.67,0:02:08.29,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們依舊奮勇直前 直到燃盡生命之火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}發得出聲音的玩具也好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:14.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}能吹飛疼痛的魔法也好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:18.55,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}於我而言都是無價之寶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:23.68,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世無永恆 萬物皆為雲煙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:34.09,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}我們仍然義無反顧 直到燃盡生命之火
